    <string name="accessibility_disclosure">Mafla uses the Accessibility Service API for one feature only: Double tap to lock. It lets Mafla lock your screen when you double tap on the home screen.
    \n\nThe service only sees taps inside Mafla, and only uses them to lock your screen. It does not look at other apps or anything you type.
    \n\nNo data is collected, stored or shared. Nothing leaves your device.
    \n\nTap Accept, then turn on Mafla in your device\'s Accessibility settings.</string>
